.TH "PERCH-ACCOUNT-PASSWD" "1" "" "perch" "perch manual"
.SH NAME
perch\-account\-passwd \- change an account password
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B perch account passwd [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Replace the account's Argon2id password hash. Existing IMAP and submission sessions are not terminated.
.SH NOTES
.IP \(bu 2
Prompts for the new password when \-\-password is omitted.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-config <value>
configuration file (default: ~/.config/perch/perch.yaml)
.TP
.B \-\-email <value>
account email
.TP
.B \-\-password <value>
new password (prompted when empty)
.TP
.B \-\-help, \-h
show help
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
perch account passwd \-\-email you@example.com
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBperch\fR(1), \fBperch\-account\fR(1)
